LOB-S5 (https://github.com/peernagy/LOBS5, MIT, Copyright (c) 2022 Linderman Lab) at
aa36029e9d348a017d00efc37c6b6dda89fab150: compatibility fixes for current JAX / Flax / NumPy 2.

- jax.random.PRNGKeyArray and np.DeviceArray type annotations -> jax.Array
- FrozenDict.unfreeze() -> flax.core.unfreeze()
- np.sum over a generator -> np.sum(np.fromiter(...))  (NumPy 2)
- torchaudio / torchvision imported lazily (unused for LOB data)
- message-only mode (--use_book_data False): collate only the fields __getitem__ returns
- int(random.randint(key, (1,), ...)) -> shape () ; checkpoint dir made absolute for orbax

No model, loss, tokenizer or training-default changes. Apply with
`git -C $LOBS5_DIR apply patches/lobs5-jax-compat.patch` (scripts/data/setup_libs.sh --with-lobs5 does this).

